### Feature Payment — CREATE
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. Recurso `POST /api/payments`: solo lo concede ADMIN (SELLER no).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login SELLER
# @name loginSeller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "seller",
  "password": "Seller123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@sellerToken = {{loginSeller.response.body.$.access_token}}

### CREATE — admin -> 201
# @name createPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceType": "order",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "method": "cash",
  "amount": 25000,
  "date": "2026-10-05T15:00:00Z",
  "status": "active"
}

### 403 — el SELLER NO tiene concedido `POST /api/payments` (deny by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceType": "order",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "method": "cash",
  "amount": 25000,
  "date": "2026-10-05T15:00:00Z"
}

### 401 — sin token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceType": "order",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "method": "cash",
  "amount": 25000,
  "date": "2026-10-05T15:00:00Z"
}
